{"id":"477467","name":"雪耳乌鸡汤","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/477467/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"乌鸡","amount":"1只"},{"name":"雪耳","amount":"1朵"},{"name":"响螺片","amount":"3片"}],"sub":[{"name":"红枣","amount":"10颗"},{"name":"枸杞子","amount":"1把"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"雪耳泡发。","img":"images/477467/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"响螺片洗洗，用水泡软。(泡的水留用。)","img":"images/477467/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"乌鸡去皮，剁大块。","img":"images/477467/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把乌鸡，响螺片飞水。(冷水下锅，水开后煮2-3分钟。)","img":"images/477467/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"乌鸡洗去浮沫。","img":"images/477467/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"响螺片切小块。","img":"images/477467/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"红枣去核。","img":"images/477467/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"枸杞子","img":"images/477467/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"雪耳去蒂，撕小块，放入汤锅，倒入泡响螺的水和适量的清水。(我用电压力锅)。","img":"images/477467/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"把其他材料也放入，盖上盖子，按煲汤键开煮。。","img":"images/477467/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"煲好排气后就可以开盖，撇去肥油即可。(响螺片带咸味，可不放盐。)","img":"images/477467/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"清润滋阴。","img":"images/477467/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}